# What is not part of a script.
#
# The engine reads this when pushing a script to a repository: what it excludes
# is left untouched there. The local tooling (scripts/lib/ignore.js) reads the
# same file when it collects a script's assets, so an upload and a push agree
# on what belongs to the script.

